chroma_data/

# Raw dataset (third-party content, not redistributable)
# NOTE: negating a file inside an ignored dir doesn't work if the dir itself
# is ignored (git won't descend to check it) — must un-ignore each level.
data/*
!data/processed

# 평가셋은 공개 (재현 가능하게) — 단, 중간 산출물과 원시 결과 덤프는 제외
!data/eval/
data/eval/**/_workspace/
data/eval/results/

.claude/

